==English==

===Etymology===
Borrowed from {{bor|en|frm|coagulation}}, from {{der|en|la|coagulatio|coagulatio, coagulationem}}.
Morphologically {{suffix|en|coagulate|ion|nocat=1}}

===Pronunciation===
* {{rhymes|en|eɪʃən|s=5}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun|~}}

# {{senseid|en|size precipitation}}The [[precipitation]] of [[suspended]] [[particle]]s as they increase in size by any of several physical or chemical processes. (e.g. coagulation of proteins)
# The [[process]] by which [[blood]] forms solid [[clot]]s.
# Similar solidification of other materials (e.g. of [[tofu]]).

====Antonyms====
* {{l|en|dissolution}}
* {{l|en|declumping}}
* {{l|en|peptization}}

